> Count the actual work and random stream

Let T be restarts, n vertices, A directed adjacency entries and L the total full
local passes across restarts. Construction examines all still-unassigned
vertices at each placement, giving

$$S=T\frac{n(n+1)}2,\quad R=S,\quad W=Tn,\quad
F=nL,\quad N_{local}=AL,\quad N_{objective}=AT.$$
\alttext(Each restart scores a triangular number of candidates, tests each for RCL membership and consumes n RNG words. Each full local scan tests n vertices and visits A entries; one final objective evaluation per restart also visits A entries.)

Here S is candidate scores, R membership tests, W RNG words and F flip tests.
Construction neighbor inspections depend on when vertices are assigned and are
bounded by TnA. Overall selected loop work is O(T(n²+nA)+LA), plus reciprocal
validation O(A log A+n). Local passes are not assumed constant or polynomial in
graph size. These counts exclude validation, allocation, snapshots and CPU
instructions.

The trace admits one record per construction step, one per actual candidate, one
per flip test, and one per restart plus its 2n copied partition labels. Its
logical entry count is

$$H=T\left(1+3n+\frac{n(n+1)}2\right)+nL.$$
\alttext(Capture includes restart records and both partition snapshots, construction step and candidate records, and all actual local flip-test records.)

These mixed logical units are not individual scalar fields, bytes, capacities or
peak RAM. Known restart snapshot units are admitted before its construction,
then actual construction and flip units online before their score or delta work.
Histories are owned and copy independently. Scalar/work-only calls retain no
optional history.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/grasp_work.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");

    const dm::algorithms::GraspAdjacency adj{{{1, 1}, {2, 2}}, {{0, 1}, {2, 3}},
                                             {{0, 2}, {1, 3}}};
    std::print("| alpha | candidate scores | membership tests | RNG words | local passes | flip tests | " "construction visits | local visits | captured entries |\n| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: " "| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n");
    std::vector<double> x, passes;
    for (double alpha : {0., .3, 1.}) {
        const auto t =
            dm::algorithms::grasp_max_cut_trace(3, adj, 10, alpha, 3);
        const auto &w = t.run.work;
        const std::size_t expected =
            10 * (1 + 3 * 3 + 3 * 4 / 2) + 3 * w.local_passes;
        if (w.candidate_scores != 60 || w.rcl_tests != 60 ||
            w.rng_words != 30 || w.flip_tests != 3 * w.local_passes ||
            w.local_neighbors != 6 * w.local_passes ||
            w.objective_neighbors != 60 || t.captured_entries != expected)
            throw std::runtime_error("work identities");
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", alpha,
                   w.candidate_scores, w.rcl_tests, w.rng_words, w.local_passes,
                   w.flip_tests, w.construction_neighbors, w.local_neighbors,
                   t.captured_entries);
        x.push_back(alpha);
        passes.push_back(w.local_passes);
    }
    const auto t = dm::algorithms::grasp_max_cut_trace(3, adj, 1, 1, 3);
    bool quota = false, passcap = false, loop = false;
    dm::algorithms::GraspOptions o;
    o.max_trace_entries = t.captured_entries - 1;
    try {
        (void) dm::algorithms::grasp_max_cut_trace(3, adj, 1, 1, 3, o);
    } catch (const std::length_error &) {
        quota = true;
    }
    o.max_trace_entries = t.captured_entries;
    const auto exact = dm::algorithms::grasp_max_cut_trace(3, adj, 1, 1, 3, o);
    o.max_local_passes = 1;
    try {
        (void) dm::algorithms::grasp_max_cut_run(3, adj, 1, 1, 3, o);
    } catch (const std::length_error &) {
        passcap = true;
    }
    try {
        (void) dm::algorithms::grasp_max_cut(1, {{{0, 1}}});
    } catch (const std::invalid_argument &) {
        loop = true;
    }
    std::print("\nOne-short capture cap rejects: {}; exact cap retains {} entries; a one-pass budget " "rejects unfinished improvement: {}; self-loop rejected: {}.\n",
               quota, exact.captured_entries, passcap, loop);
    auto p = dm::graphics::RPlot::create();
    p.bars(x, passes, "actual local passes", {37, 99, 235}, .15).title(
        "Same restart count; local work depends on construction").x_label(
        "RCL alpha (one continuing seed3 stream per run)").y_label(
        "full local scans, terminal scans included").y_limits(0, 30).save_svg(
        "build/grasp_work.svg");
    if (!quota || !passcap || !loop)
        throw std::runtime_error("resource controls");
}
```
